# AI Text Narrator

An AI-powered text narration web application that converts user input into AI-generated narration and reads it aloud using browser speech synthesis.

## Features

- AI text narration
- Voice output
- Voice selection
- Copy output feature
- Loading indicator
- Error handling
- Express backend API
- Google Gemini integration

## Technologies Used

Frontend:
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Backend:
- Node.js
- Express.js

AI:
- Google Gemini API

